  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Technical Guidance for Mainstreaming Protection of Migrant Children into National Child Protection Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to bring together IOM representatives and representatives from States&apos; ministries, departments and agencies related to social welfare and child protection to identify core challenges in meeting the needs of migrant children through national referral pathways and national child protection systems. They will also work together to develop a set of concrete recommendations on mainstreaming migrant children into such pathways and systems. These recommendations will be transformed into a guidance document that will be translated, distributed to all Member States, and made available online.</narrative>
  </description>
